WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Inside the dream, Fischer has reached his father's bedside.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.400
His father directs him toward the safe.

00:13.100 --> 00:16.500
The safe is closed. Fischer knows the combination.

00:16.500 --> 00:20.000
Question Fischer. Recover it before the dream collapses.
